# Everything on this host is the sign-in-gated admin SPA except the public docs
# and the login page, so the default is noindex and those two surfaces detach
# it ("!" removes a header set by an earlier rule). A catch-all rather than a
# route list: any unknown path also serves the SPA shell and must not be
# indexed either. See docs/docs-site.md § SEO.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/docs/*
  ! X-Robots-Tag
/login
  ! X-Robots-Tag
